@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed — Version-bound rendering inputs and separate outputs
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Exact draft version\nowner-only preview" as D
rectangle "Committed publication manifest\ncontent / selection / language / artifact provenance" as P
rectangle "Identified layout / template inputs\nsection structure / style parameters\nversioning and safe content rules pending" as T
rectangle "Evaluated safe renderer\nexact input and output contract" as R
rectangle "Web preview / eligible publication page" as W
rectangle "Generated PDF\nseparate actual rendition work / Files protection" as F
rectangle "Print view\nonly if actually selected by source/representation policy" as V
D --> R : explicit preview, never auto-publish
P --> R : exact committed revision
T --> R : reproducibility requires stable inputs
R --> W
R --> F : separately report actual generation / availability
R ..> V : conditional output
note bottom of R
 Uploaded PDF is a distinct representation; not silently regenerated or relabeled.
 Theme/layout edits must not rewrite prior actual-material claims.
end note

@enduml
